        ["We'll not use your compost on:<br>Tree patches<br>Allotment patches<br>Hops patches<br>Bush patches<br>Herb patches<br>Flower patches<br>Special patches<br>"] = "No usaremos su abono en:<br>Parches de árboles<br>Parches de huertos<br>Parches de lúpulo<br>Parches de arbustos<br>Parches de hierbas<br>Parches de flores<br>Parches especiales<br>",
